I checked the FDP data. NGCB transaction purpose codes are present in the authorization table. Around 2.39% of DPNGCB and 2.16% of NGCBRF authorization transactions do not have a corresponding transaction status record. A similar ~1–2% pattern exists across the other SmartPay transaction purpose codes as well, so this does not appear to be NGCB-specific. Since the BDP transformation inner joins authorization transactions to the latest status, transactions without a status record will not flow into the final BDP output.